pourrna (1.3.0-1) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * --max-bp-detour: direct path deviation in base pairs (the paper's Delta_bp)
  * --max-bp-dist-legacy: reproduce the published results of pourRNA 1.0
  * Script to reproduce the sv11 results of the paper
  * Fixes for rates, energy thresholds, no-lonely-pair moves, filters and minh
  * Faster rate matrix and barrier tree, no data races, deterministic output
  * Build with GCC 13 and ViennaRNA flags from pkg-config

